  "title": "Outstanding Herbal Vietnamese Shiso Leaf Noodles",
  "description": "This dish features shiso leaf, brine dry, and ayurvedic sattvic friendly ingredients, making it perfect for a date night Vietnamese dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Vietnamese",
